Gonzalo Lera-Romero, Juan José Miranda-Bront and Francisco Soulignac wrote the original code (https://github.com/gleraromero/networks2020), described in the article https://doi.org/10.1002/net.21937. Florian Rascoussier made the changes of this repository, wrote its tests and maintains it.

This repository is not affiliated with, and not endorsed by, the authors of the original code.
